{"id":282,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It will dedicate itself to defending a master it has come to adore. Its pure white dress, reminiscent of those worn by ladies of nobility, is the dress of one who is willing to risk their life."},{"games":["Shield","X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole."},{"games":["Sword","Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its Trainer."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Gardevoir has the psychokinetic power to distort the dimensions and create a small black hole. This Pokémon will try to protect its Trainer even at the risk of its own life."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Gardevoir has the ability to read the future. If it senses impending danger to its Trainer, this Pokémon is said to unleash its psychokinetic energy at full power."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It unleashes psychokinetic energy at full power when protecting a Trainer it has bonded closely with."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It will try to guard its trusted Trainer with its life. It has the ability to see the future."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It apparently does not feel the pull of gravity because it supports itself with psychic power. It will give its life to protect its TRAINER."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Trace","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon copies an opposing Pokémon's Ability."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like","Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow",